  "notes": [
    "Anchor is 0x3e829fa4 (sender 0x9d38f94a, 23 recycles), two days before the DeFiHackLabs tx 0x4848bae0, which is in the campaign. The owner's only calls were launch (0x01339c21) and renouncing ownership; the deployment is the reset.",
    "Campaign: every transaction emitting SellRecycledFromBlackHole at least 23 times, from deployment to block 88447689; the busiest earlier transaction emitted two, and the drains recur about daily as the 10% cap resets. Loss is the XDK/GPC pair's GPC outflow; GPC and XDK have no DefiLlama price, so GPC is valued at the 24.2156 WBNB the attackers realised by selling it into the WBNB/GPC pair in the same transactions (rule 12) and XDK at nothing."
